  "memories": [
    {
      "id": "m-20250223-0",
      "key": "mem_20250223_0",
      "day": "20250223",
      "text": "The spoon was in the ink, black to the neck. The week's firing was sixpence, once. The letter stayed folded.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250223/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250223",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250223#meeting_104000_720",
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250223#meeting_122000_720",
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250223#meeting_140000_720"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250224-1",
      "key": "mem_20250224_1",
      "day": "20250224",
      "text": "Twenty-four lines in two days. Thirteen of them were Monday's.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250224/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250224",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250224#meeting_091000_720",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250224#frame_140500_180",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250224#meeting_164500_840"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250225-2",
      "key": "mem_20250225_2",
      "day": "20250225",
      "text": "Two inches into a post from 1576, and two mornings in March. The ground falls back on the thirteenth of April, 1597.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250225/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250225",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250225#meeting_100000_720",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250225#photo_102500_0",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250225#frame_140500_180"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250226-3",
      "key": "mem_20250226_3",
      "day": "20250226",
      "text": "You were glad to be thought portable. Two quires are laid by at fourpence halfpenny.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250226/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250226",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250226#frame_084000_180",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250226#call_113000_240",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250226#frame_113000_120"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250227-4",
      "key": "mem_20250227_4",
      "day": "20250227",
      "text": "Anne wrote that the cough is gone. You called it just news. The stool is level, and the wedge is three leaves cut in January.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250227/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250227",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250227#meeting_090500_720",
          "sol://facets/stratford/activities/20250227#frame_114000_180",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250227#frame_140500_180"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250228-5",
      "key": "mem_20250228_5",
      "day": "20250228",
      "text": "From the west window you saw a woman leave the church porch. At night you fair-copied one line and put a cross in the almanac.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250228/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250228",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250228#frame_084000_240",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250228#frame_140500_180",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250228#note_211000_360"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250301-6",
      "key": "mem_20250301_6",
      "day": "20250301",
      "text": "You played Egeon. Last Saturday's thirty shillings stayed the last share. You set that thirty down at home.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250301/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250301",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250301#meeting_091000_720",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250301#frame_140500_180",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250301#meeting_164500_840"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "said": [
    {
      "id": "s-20250223-0",
      "key": "said_20250223_0",
      "day": "20250223",
      "quote": "I am not pleased. I am relieved, which is a meaner feeling, and it will do.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/household/activities/20250223#meeting_140000_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250224-1",
      "key": "said_20250224_1",
      "day": "20250224",
      "quote": "I will not improve a truth into a promise.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/household/activities/20250224#meeting_091000_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250224-2",
      "key": "said_20250224_2",
      "day": "20250224",
      "quote": "What I meant is not what they did. What they did is the news.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/company/activities/20250224#meeting_164500_840"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250225-3",
      "key": "said_20250225_3",
      "day": "20250225",
      "quote": "Then the wood is the honest one. It remembers rain.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/company/activities/20250225#meeting_100000_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250226-4",
      "key": "said_20250226_4",
      "day": "20250226",
      "quote": "I am glad to be thought portable. A book that fits a pocket will outlive a book that needs a table, and the penny was never the point of that one.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250226#call_113000_240"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250227-5",
      "key": "said_20250227_5",
      "day": "20250227",
      "quote": "Just news. It's rarer.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/stratford/activities/20250227#meeting_171500_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250228-6",
      "key": "said_20250228_6",
      "day": "20250228",
      "quote": "The black-eyed. Hm. No.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250228#memo_213000_60"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250301-7",
      "key": "said_20250301_7",
      "day": "20250301",
      "quote": "The Queen's twenty pounds is not in this room. I would have noticed twenty pounds. They are heavier than a mood.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/company/activities/20250301#meeting_164500_840"
      }
    }
  ]
}
